\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>@{variables('varImageTag')}</p>\n\n<p style=\" padding-left: 30px;\">\n\n <table width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #f9f9f9; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 20px;\">\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <h2 style=\"color: #0066cc;\">Stay Updated: Subscribe to the Ruiz Foods Master Calendar!</h2>\n                \n                <p>Dear <strong>@{outputs('Get_user_profile_(V2)')?['body/displayName']}</strong>,</p>\n                \n                <p>Thank you for subscribing to the <strong>Ruiz Foods Corporate Intranet Master Calendar 2025</strong>! This calendar is your go-to resource for staying informed about all the important dates, events, and milestones happening across Ruiz Foods.</p>\n\n                <p>By syncing the Master Calendar to your Outlook, you'll always have key dates like holidays, corporate meetings, training sessions, and special events right at your fingertips.</p>\n                \n                <h3>How to Sync the Calendar</h3>\n                <ol>\n                    <li>Click the link below to sync the Master Calendar directly to your Outlook:</li>\n                    <p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;\">\n                        <a href=\"stssync://sts/?ver=1.1&type=calendar&cmd=add-folder&base-url=https%3A%2F%2Fruizfoods%2Esharepoint%2Ecom%2Fsites%2FRuizNetPortal&list-url=%2FLists%2FMaster%2520Calendar%2520Sync%2F&guid=%7B284250a1%2Df980%2D419d%2D9d77%2D373c14b37f7d%7D&site-name=Corporate%20Intranet&list-name=Master%20Calendar%20Sync\" \n                           style=\"background-color: #0066cc; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 16px;\">\n                            Sync the Master Calendar\n                        </a>\n                    </p>\n                    <li>When prompted in Outlook, confirm that you’d like to add the calendar.</li>\n                    <li>The Master Calendar will now be available alongside your personal calendar.</li>\n                </ol>\n\n                <h3>Benefits of Subscribing</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><strong>📅 Stay Informed:</strong> Never miss an important date or event.</li>\n                    <li><strong>⏰ Plan Ahead:</strong> Be prepared for key deadlines and meetings.</li>\n                    <li><strong>🔄 Real-Time Updates:</strong> Automatically receive updates for any new or changed events.</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <p>If you have any questions or need assistance with the sync process, feel free to reach out to <strong>Christina Johnson</strong> at <a href=\"mailto:christinaj@ruizfoods.com\" style=\"color: #0066cc;\">christinaj@ruizfoods.com</a>.</p>\n\n                <p>Thank you for being part of the Ruiz Foods family and staying connected with everything that matters!</p>\n\n              \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n\n\n</p>\n<br><br>\n <table style=\"border-collapse: separate; line-height: 100%; background-color: #008345; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background: #008345; border: none; border-radius: 3px; cursor: auto; mso-padding-alt: 10px 25px;\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#008345\"><a style=\"background: #008345; border-radius: 3px; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; margin: 0; mso-padding-alt: 0px; padding: 10px 25px; text-decoration: none; text-transform: none;\" href=\"stssync://sts/?ver=1.1&type=calendar&cmd=add-folder&base-url=https%3A%2F%2Fruizfoods%2Esharepoint%2Ecom%2Fsites%2FRuizNetPortal&list-url=%2FLists%2FMaster%2520Calendar%2520Sync%2F&guid=%7B284250a1%2Df980%2D419d%2D9d77%2D373c14b37f7d%7D&site-name=Corporate%20Intranet&list-name=Master%20Calendar%20Sync\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Sync the Master Calendar</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","emailMessage/Bcc":"HaaronGCONSULT@ruizfoods.com","emailMessage/Importance":"Normal"},"authentication":"@parameters('$authentication')"}},"Get_file_content_using_path_-_LOGO":{"runAfter":{"Get_response_details":["Succeeded"]},"metadata":{"operationMetadataId":"3263c193-06f7-4b88-81fa-5e16995b9755"},"type":"OpenApiConnection","inputs":{"host":{"apiId":"/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline","connectionName":"shared_sharepointonline","operationId":"GetFileContentByPath"},"parameters":{"dataset":"https://ruizfoods.sharepoint.com/","path":"/SiteAssets/__sitelogo__ruizsitelogo.png","inferContentType":true},"authentication":"@parameters('$authentication')"}},"Get_user_profile_(V2)":{"runAfter":{"Initialize_variable_-_varImageTag":["Succeeded"]},"metadata":{"operationMetadataId":"cdf35d60-e968-4d65-a268-1e743a29c1fc"},"type":"OpenApiConnection","inputs":{"host":{"apiId":"/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365users","connectionName":"shared_office365users_1","operationId":"UserProfile_V2"},"parameters":{"id":"@outputs('Get_response_details')?['body/responder']"},"authentication":"@parameters('$authentication')"}}},"description":"This flow triggers when new suscriotion form is submitted, it prepares and send and email to the suscriber with the hyperlink for the user to suscribe to the Master Calendar Sync list that uses the classic experience. So users can export to outlook the Master Calendar events."},"connectionReferences":{"shared_microsoftforms":{"connectionName":"shared-microsoftform-7e48760b-66dc-49d3-8c2a-b8d8360812bb","source":"Embedded","id":"/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_microsoftforms","tier":"NotSpecified","apiName":"microsoftforms","isProcessSimpleApiReferenceConversionAlreadyDone":false},"shared_office365":{"connectionName":"d8fe850e4d5144f4b4ab67202e949ec3","sourc